            "MCP (Model Context Protocol) is an open standard that lets external AI tools talk to this WordPress site. Once enabled, Claude Desktop, Cursor, Windsurf or another MCP client can manage posts, pages, products, media and settings directly. Clients authenticate with a JWT token (see below) and only ever get the operations you allow.": [
                "MCP (Model Context Protocol) je otev\u0159en\u00fd standard, kter\u00fd umo\u017e\u0148uje extern\u00edm AI n\u00e1stroj\u016fm komunikovat s t\u00edmto webem WordPress. Po zapnut\u00ed mohou Claude Desktop, Cursor, Windsurf nebo jin\u00fd MCP klient p\u0159\u00edmo spravovat p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvky, str\u00e1nky, produkty, m\u00e9dia a nastaven\u00ed. Klienti se ov\u011b\u0159uj\u00ed pomoc\u00ed JWT tokenu (viz n\u00ed\u017ee) a z\u00edskaj\u00ed v\u017edy jen operace, kter\u00e9 povol\u00edte."
            ],
